WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.940
Pick up a heavy bag,
raise it to chest height,

2
00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:05.340
and hold it perfectly still.

3
00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:08.210
Ten minutes later, your arms ache.

4
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:09.790
They are burning.

5
00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.880
You badly want to put it down.

6
00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:13.460
You're exhausted.

7
00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:16.080
But how much work have
you done on the bag?

8
00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:20.510
In this mission, you'll pin down
exactly what work means in physics,

9
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.830
and why it is measured in joules.

10
00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:26.780
Then you'll pull a load across
level snow with a rope at an angle,

11
00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:29.160
and find the work done by the rope.

12
00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:32.810
Your mission: find out how
much work you do on the bag,

13
00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.120
and explain why.
